{"id":2265,"date":"2024-09-19T12:32:37","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:32:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2265"},"modified":"2025-10-02T10:59:11","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T10:59:11","slug":"cardboard-ornament-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-ornament-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Ornament Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Protective Packaging That Balances Safety and Seasonal Appeal<\/h2>\n<p>We at <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><em>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em><\/a><\/strong> manufacture high-quality <strong>cardboard ornament boxes<\/strong> that help protect, store, and display holiday ornaments with care. These boxes are widely used for personal storage, retail sales, and festive shipping. Built with precision, each box supports delicate decorations and ensures they stay secure during handling or display.<\/p>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re looking for <strong>custom ornament boxes<\/strong> for gifting or <strong>ornament boxes for shipping<\/strong>, we create packaging that balances safety with seasonal style. Each order is produced to meet your size, printing, and structural requirements\u2014with fast turnaround times and free design support included.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Reliable Ornament Packaging for All Occasions<\/h2>\n<h3>Perfect for Retail, Storage, and Gifting<\/h3>\n<p>Ornaments require secure packaging that prevents scratches, chipping, or breakage. Our <strong>ornament packaging boxes<\/strong> are built using rigid or corrugated cardboard and offer excellent durability for both display and long-term storage.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ideal for individual, boxed sets, or multi-piece collections<\/li>\n<li>Available with inserts or dividers to keep items separated<\/li>\n<li>Easy to stack, label, and store after each season<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Whether you\u2019re packaging glass balls, wooden decor, or handcrafted pieces, these boxes keep them protected and neatly arranged.<\/p>\n<h3>Designed for Practical Use and Reuse<\/h3>\n<p>Each <strong>cardboard ornament storage box<\/strong> is lightweight and space-saving. We offer both collapsible and rigid box styles to fit your shipping or storage setup.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Foldable boxes for easy post-season storage<\/li>\n<li>Die-cut compartments to prevent shifting<\/li>\n<li>Lid styles to protect against dust or light damage<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>All boxes can be shipped flat and assembled in minutes without additional tools.<\/p>\n<table style=\"height: 385px;\" width=\"906\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Description<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Box Sizes<\/td>\n<td>Custom Sizes (Single to Large Ornament Box Sets)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Materials<\/td>\n<td>White SBS, Kraft Board, Corrugated E-flute<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Printing Options<\/td>\n<td>CMYK, PMS, One-Side or Full-Panel Printing<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Coating Options<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lid Types<\/td>\n<td>Two-Piece, Magnetic Closure, Flip Top<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Box Features<\/td>\n<td>Dividers, Inserts, Window Cut-outs, Hanging Tabs<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ornament Storage Capacity<\/td>\n<td>1 to 48 compartments per box (Customizable)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Design Proofs<\/td>\n<td>3D Mockup, Flat View, or Physical Sample<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turnaround Time<\/td>\n<td>4\u20136 Business Days Standard; Rush Options Available<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Minimum Order Quantity<\/td>\n<td>Starts at 100 Units<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shipping<\/td>\n<td>Free Nationwide Delivery<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Design Services<\/td>\n<td>Free Artwork Setup and Layout Guidance<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Christmas ornament boxes cardboard and Seasonal Designs<\/h2>\n<h3>Suitable for Holiday Collections<\/h3>\n<p>Our <strong>christmas ornament boxes cardboard<\/strong> options are often used during peak festive months by decorators, crafters, and brands offering holiday items. With options like printed snowflakes, branding, or neutral kraft tones, these boxes fit both retail and home use.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Designed for tree ornaments, glass balls, and small seasonal figurines<\/li>\n<li>Multiple divider configurations to keep each item separate<\/li>\n<li>Optional clear windows for viewing ornaments without opening the box<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>These designs are commonly used in retail sets and shipped directly to customers without requiring repacking.<\/p>\n<h3>Large and Small Size Options Available<\/h3>\n<p>We offer solutions for every size need\u2014from tiny glass items to oversized collector pieces.<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Large cardboard ornament boxes<\/strong> for sets of 12 or more<\/li>\n<li><strong>Cardboard ornament boxes with lids<\/strong> to provide closure during transit<\/li>\n<li>Boxes with adjustable compartments for fragile or irregular shapes<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>Many clients also request <strong>cardboard ornament boxes bulk<\/strong> for wholesale storage or large-scale gift sets.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Durable and Reusable Ornament Storage Solutions<\/h2>\n<h3>Smart Interior Features<\/h3>\n<p>We provide <strong>cardboard ornament boxes with dividers<\/strong> to help you manage internal organization. These dividers are removable and can be arranged to fit different product sizes or configurations.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Made from the same sturdy cardboard for a cohesive look<\/li>\n<li>Optional foam or paperboard inserts available<\/li>\n<li>Keeps items secure even during long-term storage<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>If you&#8217;re assembling seasonal gifts, we also support <strong>cardboard ornament boxes DIY<\/strong> kits. These can be pre-scored and printed with branding or holiday artwork, ready for assembly and decoration.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Choose Cardboard Ornament Boxes in Bulk<\/h2>\n<h3>Packaging That Works Across Seasons<\/h3>\n<p>Bulk ordering makes sense for brands that prepare seasonal kits, product lines, or resale packaging. Ordering <strong data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"291\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cardboard-boxes-for-specific-uses\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"289\">Cardboard Boxes For Specific Uses<\/a><\/strong> bulk allows for consistent branding and reduced per-unit cost.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Reduced production cost for high-volume runs<\/li>\n<li>Streamlined storage with flat-packed delivery<\/li>\n<li>Easy reordering using saved box templates<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>If you&#8217;re also managing multiple product categories, explore our Cardboard Boxes For Specific Uses to find options for gifts, candles, food, or glassware.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>How to Place a Custom Order with Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/h2>\n<h3>Simple Steps to Get Started<\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Share your desired box size, layout, and divider specs<\/li>\n<li>Choose coating and finish options<\/li>\n<li>Upload artwork or request free design support<\/li>\n<li>Approve your 3D mock-up or sample<\/li>\n<li>Receive your shipment with free nationwide delivery<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>Boxes are made to fit your shipping, storage, or retail needs.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full\" dir=\"auto\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-48\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\">\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto py-5 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @[37rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @[72rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:32rem] @[34rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @[64rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto flex max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 text-base gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 group\/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"group\/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\n<div class=\"relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"29846d36-625c-434d-a291-d45f77998d67\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light\">\n<h2 data-start=\"199\" data-end=\"242\">Other Useful Packaging Options Available<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"244\" data-end=\"579\">For those who need portable and easy-to-carry packaging, we also offer a dedicated range of <strong data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"438\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-boxes-with-handle\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"436\">Cardboard Boxes With Handle<\/a><\/strong>. These are ideal when convenience and presentation are both priorities, especially for retail items, event giveaways, or personalized gifts.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"887\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Adding handles to your boxes simplifies transportation and adds a practical element to your packaging design. Whether you&#8217;re planning a holiday pop-up, packaging bulk ornaments, or building a custom gift set, handled boxes can serve as a helpful alternative or complement to your ornament packaging lineup.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/article>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Shop Cardboard Boxes Is the Right Fit for Ornament Packaging<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Custom sizes and structures for single or multiple ornaments<\/li>\n<li>Options including dividers, window cut-outs, and magnetic lids<\/li>\n<li>Coating finishes like Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV<\/li>\n<li>Free design setup and digital proofing<\/li>\n<li>Bulk pricing for seasonal promotions and wholesale supply<\/li>\n<li>Corrugated and rigid cardboard materials available<\/li>\n<li>Fast production with free shipping across the U.S.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes for high-quality cardboard ornament boxes at wholesale prices. Our boxes are made from durable materials and are perfect for storing and protecting your delicate ornaments. We offer a variety of customization options, including coating, design, and size. Our fast turnaround times ensure you get your boxes when you need them. Get in touch.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2398,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[182],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2265","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cardboard-boxes-for-specific-uses","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Order Custom Cardboard Ornament Boxes &amp; Packaging<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Organize and safeguard your Christmas ornaments with our high-quality cardboard boxes. Durable, affordable, and customizable.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-ornament-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Order Custom Cardboard Ornament Boxes &amp; Packaging\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Organize and safeguard your Christmas ornaments with our high-quality cardboard boxes. Durable, affordable, and customizable.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-ornament-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Shop Cardboard Boxes\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-10-02T10:59:11+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/Cardboard-Ornament-Boxes-1.jpg\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"1200\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/jpeg\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"5 minutes\" \/>\n<!-- \/ Yoast SEO plugin. -->","yoast_head_json":{"title":"Order Custom Cardboard Ornament Boxes & Packaging","description":"Organize and safeguard your Christmas ornaments with our high-quality cardboard boxes. Durable, affordable, and customizable.","robots":{"index":"index","follow":"follow","max-snippet":"max-snippet:-1","max-image-preview":"max-image-preview:large","max-video-preview":"max-video-preview:-1"},"canonical":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-ornament-boxes\/","og_locale":"en_US","og_type":"article","og_title":"Order Custom Cardboard Ornament Boxes & Packaging","og_description":"Organize and safeguard your Christmas ornaments with our high-quality cardboard boxes. Durable, affordable, and customizable.","og_url":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-ornament-boxes\/","og_site_name":"Shop Cardboard Boxes","article_modified_time":"2025-10-02T10:59:11+00:00","og_image":[{"width":1200,"height":1200,"url":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/Cardboard-Ornament-Boxes-1.jpg","type":"image\/jpeg"}],"twitter_card":"summary_large_image","twitter_misc":{"Est. reading time":"5 minutes"},"schema":{"@